UI AutoSetup prototype: licences and credits
============================================

This repository combines four tools by three authors. It is for Awin staff
only: neither it nor any part of it may be used, copied or shared outside
Awin, even where it can be seen. Within that, each part is covered by its
own author's terms, as set out below. NOTICE lists the files in each part
and what was changed here.

  Part                                          Author             Terms
  --------------------------------------------  -----------------  ------------
  Checklist Autofill, AutoSetup, and the code   Oscar Coleman      Awin staff
  that joins the four tools                                        only
