Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Rodier Sangibala

Moonfill was created by Rodier Sangibala
(https://github.com/OptimusRodier/moonfill, branch dev). Rodier sets its
terms. Section 1 does not apply to Moonfill's code, only to the changes
