3. Internal Review (Optimus Internal Review)
--------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 Kaio Da Mota

Optimus Internal Review (v0.2.23, from optimus-internal-review-checker,
branch feat/v0.2-internal-review) was created by Kaio Da Mota. It is adapted
here, in autofill/review/, to run inside this extension. Kaio sets its terms.
Section 1 covers only the adaptations that NOTICE lists, not Kaio's code.
Until Kaio publishes a licence for it, ask Kaio before reusing its code
outside this project.


4. Tools used only for development
----------------------------------

The tests in autofill/dev/ use jsdom (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2010 Elijah
Insua), installed with npm. jsdom isn't part of the extension and isn't
included in this repository.


